                "end": 40,
                "start": 40
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Respondent argues that the petitioner\u2019s proposed standard would increase jurisdictional litigation and costs, contrary to the goal of reducing such expenses."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Chilton",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "56020f80f97b5d0067ac93ebb4519d0f2367e4eb21cf0a0f17ea2bd1b0bffa90",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-56020f80f97b-0001-0005"
